{"page":12,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:77","surah":2,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَا يَعْلَمُونَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَعْلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعْلِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do they not know that God is well aware of what they conceal and what they reveal?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَا","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalā","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"they know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يُسِرُّونَ","en_gloss":"they conceal","transliteration":"yusirrūna","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُعْلِنُونَ","en_gloss":"they declare","transliteration":"yuʿ'linūna","verse_key":"2:77"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٧٧","en_gloss":"(77)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:77"}]},{"verse_key":"2:78","surah":2,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُمْ أُمِّيُّونَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ إِلَّآ أَمَانِىَّ وَإِنْ هُمْ إِلَّا يَظُنُّونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Some of them are uneducated, and know the Scripture only through wish-ful thinking. They rely on guesswork.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"And among them","transliteration":"wamin'hum","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُمِّيُّونَ","en_gloss":"(are) unlettered ones","transliteration":"ummiyyūna","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(who) do not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمَانِىَّ","en_gloss":"wishful thinking","transliteration":"amāniyya","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنْ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"(do anything) except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَظُنُّونَ","en_gloss":"guess","transliteration":"yaẓunnūna","verse_key":"2:78"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٧٨","en_gloss":"(78)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:78"}]},{"verse_key":"2:79","surah":2,"ayah":79,"ar_uthmani":"فَوَيْلٌ لِّلَّذِينَ يَكْتُبُونَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ بِأَيْدِيهِمْ ثُمَّ يَقُولُونَ هَـٰذَا مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ لِيَشْتَرُوا۟ بِهِۦ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا ۖ فَوَيْلٌ لَّهُم مِّمَّا كَتَبَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ وَوَيْلٌ لَّهُم مِّمَّا يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So woe to those who write something down with their own hands and then claim, ‘This is from God,’ in order to make some small gain. Woe to them for what their hands have written! Woe to them for all that they have earned!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"So woe","transliteration":"fawaylun","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكْتُبُونَ","en_gloss":"write","transliteration":"yaktubūna","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِأَيْدِيهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their (own) hands","transliteration":"bi-aydīhim","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"they say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":8,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"2:79"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss"